- Vanguard agreed to acquire Altruist, a digital wealth management platform and custodian for independent financial advisors, in a deal valuing Altruist at approximately $4 billion. (source: fintechfutures, 2026-08)
- Broadridge Financial Solutions expanded its digital assets platform to U.S. wealth management firms, giving broker-dealers, RIAs and wealth managers a single environment for cryptocurrencies and tokenized securities alongside conventional investments. (source: InvestmentNews, 2026-09)
