t a hybrid digital investment advice offering to make its wealth management platform more appealing to younger investors, MSN reported in August 2026. Apex Fintech Solutions formed an alliance with FusionIQ in September 2026 to give institutions a faster route to launching modern investing experiences, Yahoo Finance reported. The alliance pairs Apex's clearing and custody infrastructure with FusionIQ's digital platform, which cuts integration work for banks, credit unions, RIAs and broker-dealers."]}, {"sop": "key_players", "heading": "Who are the key players in the wealth management platform market?", "paragraphs": ["The field is crowded. The CMI report names Avaloq, Backbase, Broadridge Financial Solutions, Comarch, Dorsum, FIS, Fiserv, InvestCloud, InvestEdge, Profile Software, Prometeia, SEI Investments, SS & C Technologies, Tata Consultancy Services and Temenos among the key players. Large vendors sit alongside smaller specialists, and recent deals show the competitive landscape of the wealth management platform market consolidating around scale and AI. Envestnet agreed to acquire Vestmark in September 2026 to meet advisor demand for more sophisticated trading and tax capabilities, Yahoo Finance reported. InvestCloud supports more than US$9 trillion in assets, FinTech Magazine reported in October 2026, and its clients together manage more than 40% of the global wealth market. Vanguard agreed to acquire Altruist, a digital platform and custodian for independent advisors, in a deal valuing Altruist at about $4 billion, fintechfutures reported in August 2026. Farther raised $150 million in a Series D round led by General Atlantic to scale its intelligent wealth platform, fintechfutures reported in May 2026. Envestnet also announced AI-powered enhancements and financial planning integrations for its Wealth Management Platform in its second technology release of 2026, Pulse 2.0 reported."]}, {"sop": "conclusion", "heading": "Conclusion and Outlook for the Wealth Man